{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the office that made you feel small\u2026 to feel even smaller!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Under the Table</strong> saw you shrunk in an office surrounded by murderous giant coworkers. Now it returns with a DLC to question what happens when you get <i>more</i> shrunk<i>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle challenges on a new scale as <strong>Micro Daze</strong> strands you in Eva\u2019s office at tiny size. The desks are mountainous, the giant visitors titans, and the once timid secretary a monster to be reckoned with!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC creates a new branch in the main <strong>Under the Table</strong> game, featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Micro-sized action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 4 major character encounters + 2 minor appearances</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Over 350 images</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Over 18,000 words of new dialogue and action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 5 mini-animations (9 inc. variations)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Play as male or female</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Non-linear pathways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Dynamic choices where your early decisions affect later outcomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 An alternative way to escape the office alive\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be warned though, with added tininess comes increased peril. Can you get someone\u2019s attention to save you? Find out by playing <strong>Micro Daze</strong> today.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093460?t=1763022335","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093460?t=1763022335","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093460/7038225f1ff7760e4fef773ad9d2c9f82371f55c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763022335","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093460/7038225f1ff7760e4fef773ad9d2c9f82371f55c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763022335","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game features giants who may kill or crush you; players can get swallowed alive and stomped on. The focus is on survival, but as the giants are mostly female and mostly have bare feet, these interactions can be considered fetish content (vore/giantess/macrophilia)."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the office that made you feel small\u2026 to feel even smaller!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Under the Table</strong> saw you shrunk in an office surrounded by murderous giant coworkers. Now it returns with a DLC to question what happens when you get <i>more</i> shrunk<i>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle challenges on a new scale as <strong>Micro Daze</strong> strands you in Eva\u2019s office at tiny size. The desks are mountainous, the giant visitors titans, and the once timid secretary a monster to be reckoned with!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC creates a new branch in the main <strong>Under the Table</strong> game, featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Micro-sized action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 4 major character encounters + 2 minor appearances</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Over 350 images</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Over 18,000 words of new dialogue and action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 5 mini-animations (9 inc. variations)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Play as male or female</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Non-linear pathways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Dynamic choices where your early decisions affect later outcomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 An alternative way to escape the office alive\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be warned though, with added tininess comes increased peril. Can you get someone\u2019s attention to save you? Find out by playing <strong>Micro Daze</strong> today.</p>","developers":["RB Ashton"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3841720","name":"Under the Table"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093460/42d1982237ac38214228d4dfac87543a875b3af9/header.jpg?t=1763022335","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4093460/286054349/a232a152435973c2269059d39642b19ae2644d7d/1760864059/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762934987","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4093460/286054349/a232a152435973c2269059d39642b19ae2644d7d/1760864059/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762934987","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4093460/286054349/a232a152435973c2269059d39642b19